{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoders with weighted fusion, isolating the effect of fusion strategy. Validation accuracy (0.5399) slightly improves over the concat fusion baseline (0.5362), but remains lower than RNA-only models with scvi_n200 (0.520). The role of weighted fusion in multimodal settings remains uncertain, as well as its potential interaction with alternative encoders or aggregation methods."
}

